                                                "sense_id": "5b85313f-7b34-3c5f-9d88-f9a7d6d86aad",
                                                "text": "the green shales of a bean"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d700506c-8d8c-4afb-b2a4-b6a4c9ebe04e",
                                                "sense_id": "5b85313f-7b34-3c5f-9d88-f9a7d6d86aad",
                                                "text": "Mr. Lyell next visited the red and green shales of Cabotville, north of Springfield in Massachusetts, where some of the best Ornithichnites have been procured, chiefly in the green shale."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
